Third-party code

Parts of the user interface are adapted, with the author's permission, from
"Claude Usage Widget - The Maestro edition"
(https://github.com/TheMaestr-o/claude-usage-widget, branch maestro-edition,
commit b79d4b1), which is based on "Claude Usage Widget" by Slavomir Durej
(https://github.com/SlavomirDurej/claude-usage-widget). This covers the ring
gauges, the account bars and the rest of the styling, the refresh animation,
the menu bar pictures, the statistics view and its aggregation, the usage
notifications, the desktop widget placement, the history retention rules and
the English, Russian, Ukrainian and German translations. Those parts are
provided under the following licence:

